e rewrite our equation as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z-3 & =\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{2}-\\frac{(y-4)^{2}}{4} \\\\ z-3 & =\\frac{(x-(-2))^{2}}{2}-\\frac{(y-4)^{2}}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of a hyperbolic paraboloid with a saddle point at $(-2,4,3).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-73862/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e9078ab1-37a4-5e96-ae12-a83d5cd8804e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73862"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72301/selection/80b08715673a3aed289e3ad02b393db40939dab52da2915384ea57c0024fd312" :answer/id #uuid "bc664d05-5168-5bb6-b18a-2e35d92a5445" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-5,2,-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72301/selection/f363722f09367fa2bd449f61f57fdc023a2a5a5f513d8461980024c296ab8b85" :answer/id #uuid "98f0a16f-af08-5dc0-816e-b96361f3dd85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-5,-2,2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72301/selection/22cf260d3d96e1aa15bf33244bdde607b0d5b93c9f0726aa1f908983e1e7bded" :answer/id #uuid "a997e587-eb09-593d-823f-c1171ebccd62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(5,-2,-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72301/selection/821218d1f7b4d1ebd718a07295462e3cd7039a2e114f91b7550981448b8dfbe2" :answer/id #uuid "74f49a52-c8ba-5664-998b-e2cac8a54932" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-2,5,-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72301/selection/8bc0c0b77da3cb1db68554d21cc28037b6863ee079844ab71465fca9be69a9ed" :answer/id #uuid "4efdd0e4-a3b2-5e89-816b-86e9d992177e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(5,-2,2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72301/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2b39f7af-a443-521b-8397-14c520113e8b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72301/selection/80b08715673a3aed289e3ad02b393db40939dab52da2915384ea57c0