 & =\\pm 4 \\\\ x & =-3\\pm 4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives the solutions $x=-7$ and $x=1.$\n\nTherefore, the intercepts with the $x$-axis are $(-7,0,0)$ and $(1,0,0).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-72305/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e9078ab1-37a4-5e96-ae12-a83d5cd8804e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72305"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72303/selection/46dbe096c5dbb4830513bed4c4e3912e1fe457bd171301f419f311f9b8a85d4b" :answer/id #uuid "5b4bcb98-5300-59d7-aad5-0610d3324519" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-1,4,-5)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72303/selection/8a21c1cd15377cf3e12b65980d7bc13a70086b12ba0e54bf1371cc5f413ad1fc" :answer/id #uuid "1de0fc1d-9ae0-55c9-9a4b-eb452429efaa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-1,-4,5)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72303/selection/eb29a98aba4ece007e2c63583d6f09ec31108678727bbf7596572372e1864afd" :answer/id #uuid "98196d9f-de3c-5dbd-a40e-a5b2c06add05" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-4,1,5)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72303/selection/37cbc2782b696388cd92ca8eeb379b2784badd139a436312006faa02df39593d" :answer/id #uuid "49a31e4f-20c4-5e89-b08f-35b7418e1ef0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(1,-4,-5)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72303/selection/399488afd13e46546a0fed8e97709575308eeda9743f53263c72aa04837031c7" :answer/id #uuid "19f9ca9c-ecf7-597d-9290-d1a78e3f1efc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(1,-4,5)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72303/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "fe9b526b-4239-5703-bf7e-7c2e962699fb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72303/selection/399488afd13e46546a0fed8e97709575308eeda9743f53263c72aa04837031c7" :answer-field/choices ["q-72303/selection/46dbe096c5dbb4830513bed4c4e3912e1fe457bd171301f4